---
<svg class="svc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width={size} height={size} aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter"><path d={paths[name]} /></svg>
